# The heroes' showcase: the Konami code on the title (Up Up Down Down Left Right Left Right B A), then each hero
# steps up, shows its skills on its creature (no damage taken), takes a hit and kneels, is revived with an Elixir,
# cheers and steps back; victory, and back to the title.
nosave
wait 30
key UP
key UP
key DOWN
key DOWN
key LEFT
key RIGHT
key LEFT
key RIGHT
key B
key A
wait 60
shot h00-stage
wait 40
shot h01
wait 40
shot h02
wait 50
shot h03
wait 60
shot h04
wait 60
shot h05
wait 60
shot h06
wait 80
shot h07
wait 80
shot h08
wait 100
shot h09
wait 100
shot h10
wait 120
shot h11
wait 120
